{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"mana_crystal_large","model_identifier":"mana_crystal_large","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# mana_crystal_large\n\nLarge mana crystal node (Patch 5), 40 crystals' worth, guarded by a Fae Guardian: a broad base of black volcanic rock with a tall central cyan crystal about 94 u (2.6 m) high, eight leaning smaller crystals round it and glowing shards on the ground. Crystals are `glow_*` cubes in the mana crystal's cyan with pale cores and tips, like `mana_crystal_node`.\n\n- Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z. Bounds (full): x -82..80, y -2..94, z -62..60 units (the base sinks 2 u).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default)\n- `depleted`: the rock base with broken crystal stubs and a fallen shard\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_guardian` at (0, 106, 0): where the Fae Guardian hovers, above the central crystal's tip.\n- `fx_glow` at (0, 20, 0): the base of the central crystal."},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"rock_base#2a2630","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48,-2,-42],"to":[48,16,42],"autouv":1,"color":8,"origin":[-48,0,-42],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,174,96,192],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[192,174,276,192],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[96,174,192,192],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[276,174,360,192],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,96,84],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[96,0,192,84],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a08c0e74-2a4b-6ffd-e20a-48a2d108dcf7"},{"name":"rock_base_cap#34303e","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-34,15.5,-28],"to":[34,22,28],"autouv":1,"color":3,"origin":[-34,15.5,-28],